{"sectionId":"kinetics/rate-law","items":[{"id":"kinetics--rate-law-k001","sectionId":"kinetics/rate-law","unitId":"kinetics","subject":"chemistry","text":"반응 aA+bB→cC에 대해 반응속도 v=−(1/a)d[A]/dt=−(1/b)d[B]/dt=(1/c)d[C]/dt로 정의한다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["chemistry2e"]},{"id":"kinetics--rate-law-k002","sectionId":"kinetics/rate-law","unitId":"kinetics","subject":"chemistry","text":"실험적 속도식 v=k[A]^m[B]^n에서 차수는 실험으로 결정하며 전체 반응 계수와 반드시 일치하지 않는다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["chemistry2e"]},{"id":"kinetics--rate-law-k003","sectionId":"kinetics/rate-law","unitId":"kinetics","subject":"chemistry","text":"초기속도법은 한 반응물 농도만 바꾼 실험의 속도비로 차수를 구한다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["chemistry2e"]},{"id":"kinetics--rate-law-k004","sectionId":"kinetics/rate-law","unitId":"kinetics","subject":"chemistry","text":"속도상수의 단위는 총반응차수에 따라 달라진다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["chemistry2e"]},{"id":"kinetics--rate-law-k005","sectionId":"kinetics/rate-law","unitId":"kinetics","subject":"chemistry","text":"단일 반응물 소모 속도 −d[A]/dt=k[A]^n을 기준으로 0차 [A]=[A]₀−kt, 1차 ln[A]=ln[A]₀−kt, 2차 1/[A]=1/[A]₀+kt이다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["chemistry2e"]},{"id":"kinetics--rate-law-k006","sectionId":"kinetics/rate-law","unitId":"kinetics","subject":"chemistry","text":"반감기는 0차 [A]₀/(2k), 1차 ln2/k, 2차 1/(k[A]₀)이다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["chemistry2e"]},{"id":"kinetics--rate-law-k007","sectionId":"kinetics/rate-law","unitId":"kinetics","subject":"chemistry","text":"pseudo-first-order 조건은 다른 반응물이 큰 과량으로 유지되어 그 농도를 상수처럼 취급할 수 있을 때 사용한다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["chemistry2e"]},{"id":"kinetics--rate-law-k008","sectionId":"kinetics/rate-law","unitId":"kinetics","subject":"chemistry","text":"1차 반감기는 초기농도와 무관하다.","kind":"highlight","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["chemistry2e"]},{"id":"kinetics--rate-law-k009","sectionId":"kinetics/rate-law","unitId":"kinetics","subject":"chemistry","text":"0차 [A] vs t, 1차 ln[A] vs t, 2차 1/[A] vs t가 직선.","kind":"highlight","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["chemistry2e"]},{"id":"kinetics--rate-law-k010","sectionId":"kinetics/rate-law","unitId":"kinetics","subject":"chemistry","text":"단위: 1차 k는 s⁻¹, 2차 k는 M⁻¹s⁻¹.","kind":"highlight","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["chemistry2e"]},{"id":"kinetics--rate-law-k011","sectionId":"kinetics/rate-law","unitId":"kinetics","subject":"chemistry","text":"전체 반응 차수와 분자도를 구별한다.","kind":"highlight","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["chemistry2e"]},{"id":"kinetics--rate-law-k012","sectionId":"kinetics/rate-law","unitId":"kinetics","subject":"chemistry","text":"2차이다.","kind":"review-answer","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["chemistry2e"]}]}